{backend}` (salida {exit}, {elapsed_ms} ms; límite {deadline_ms} ms).\\n\\nSalida:\\n```text\\n{output}\\n```\\n\\nEvidencia: `{evidence}`\"\n00142|   response response_code_execution_failed_en\n00143|     intent code_execution_failed\n00144|     language en\n00145|     text \"Execution failed in `{backend}`. Nothing is reported as verified.\\n\\nVerbose observation:\\n```text\\n{log}\\n```\"\n00146|   response response_code_execution_failed_ru\n00147|     intent code_execution_failed\n00148|     language ru\n00149|     text \"Выполнение в `{backend}` завершилось сбоем. Ничего не объявлено проверенным.\\n\\nПодробное наблюдение:\\n```text\\n{log}\\n```\"\n00150|   response response_code_execution_failed_hi\n00151|     intent code_execution_failed\n00152|     language hi\n00153|     text \"`{backend}` में निष्पादन विफल हुआ। कुछ भी सत्यापित घोषित नहीं किया गया।\\n\\nविस्तृत अवलोकन:\\n```text\\n{log}\\n```\"\n00154|   response response_code_execution_failed_zh\n00155|     intent code_execution_failed\n00156|     language zh\n00157|     text \"在 `{backend}` 中执行失败。没有任何结果被声明为已验证。\\n\\n详细观察：\\n```text\\n{log}\\n```\"\n00158|   response response_code_execution_failed_es\n00159|     intent code_execution_failed\n00160|     language es\n00161|     text \"La ejecución falló en `{backend}`. No se declara nada como verificado.\\n\\nObservación detallada:\\n```text\\n{log}\\n```\"\n00162|   response response_code_execution_request_markers_en\n00163|     intent code_execution_request_markers\n00164|     language en\n00165|     text (\"run this\" \"execute this\" \"compile and run\" \"tell me exactly what it prints\")\n00166|   response response_code_execution_request_markers_ru\n00167|     intent code_execution_request_markers\n00168|     language ru\n00169|     text (\"запусти это\" \"выполни это\" \"скомпилируй и запусти\" \"что оно печатает\")\n00170|   response response_code_execution_request_markers_hi\n00171|     intent code_execution_request_markers\n00172|     language hi\