d_name_es\n00479|     intent write_program_language_unspecified_name\n00480|     language es\n00481|     text \"no se nombró ningún lenguaje de implementación para la tarea «{task}»\"\n00482|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_name_en\n00483|     intent write_program_request_unspecified_name\n00484|     language en\n00485|     text \"the request named neither a task nor an implementation language\"\n00486|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_name_ru\n00487|     intent write_program_request_unspecified_name\n00488|     language ru\n00489|     text \"в запросе не названы ни задача, ни язык реализации\"\n00490|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_name_hi\n00491|     intent write_program_request_unspecified_name\n00492|     language hi\n00493|     text \"request में न task बताया गया है और न implementation language\"\n00494|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_name_zh\n00495|     intent write_program_request_unspecified_name\n00496|     language zh\n00497|     text \"请求既没有指明任务，也没有指明实现语言\"\n00498|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_name_es\n00499|     intent write_program_request_unspecified_name\n00500|     language es\n00501|     text \"la solicitud no nombró ni una tarea ni un lenguaje de implementación\"\n00502|   response response_write_program_language_unspecified_en\n00503|     intent write_program_language_unspecified\n00504|     language en\n00505|     text \"I will not guess an implementation language. You asked for `{task}`, but the request does not say which programming language to write it in, and choosing one for you would answer a request you did not make.\\n\\nName the language — for example by adding \"\"in <language>\"\" — and I will derive the program in it.\"\n00506|   response response_write_program_language_unspecified_ru\n00507|     intent write_program_language_unspecified\n00508|     language ru\n00509|     text \"Я не угадываю язык реализации. Вы попросили `{task}`, но в запросе не сказано, на каком языке программирования его написать, а выбрать язык за вас — значит ответить на запрос, которого вы не делали.\\n\\nНазовите язык — например, добавив «на <язык>» — и я выведу программу на нём.\"\n00510|   response response_write_program_language_unspecified_hi\n00511|     intent write_program_language_unspecified\n00512|     language hi\n00513|     text \"मैं implementation language का अनुमान नहीं लगाऊँगा. आपने `{task}` माँगा, पर request में यह नहीं है कि इसे किस programming language में लिखना है, और आपकी जगह भाषा चुनना उस request का उत्तर देना होगा जो आपने की ही नहीं.\\n\\nभाषा बताइए — जैसे «<भाषा> में» जोड़कर — और मैं उसी में program derive कर दूँगा.\"\n00514|   response response_write_program_language_unspecified_zh\n00515|     intent write_program_language_unspecified\n00516|     language zh\n00517|     text \"我不会猜测实现语言。你要的是 `{task}`，但请求没有说用哪种编程语言来写，替你挑一种就等于回答了一个你并未提出的请求。\\n\\n请指明语言——例如加上「用<语言>」——我就会用它推导出程序。\"\n00518|   response response_write_program_language_unspecified_es\n00519|     intent write_program_language_unspecified\n00520|     language es\n00521|     text \"No voy a adivinar el lenguaje de implementación. Pediste `{task}`, pero la solicitud no dice en qué lenguaje de programación escribirlo, y elegirlo por ti sería responder a una solicitud que no hiciste.\\n\\nNombra el lenguaje — por ejemplo añadiendo «en <lenguaje>» — y derivaré el programa en él.\"\n00522|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_en\n00523|     intent write_program_request_unspecified\n00524|     language en\n00525|     text \"I will not guess what to write. This reads as a program request, but it names neither what the program must do nor which programming language to write it in.\\n\\nSay what the program should do and which language it should be written in, and I will derive it.\"\n00526|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_ru\n00527|     intent write_program_request_unspecified\n00528|     language ru\n00529|     text \"Я не угадываю, что писать. Это похоже на запрос программы, но в нём не названо ни что программа должна делать, ни на каком языке программирования её написать.\\n\\nСкажите, что должна делать программа и на каком языке, и я её выведу.\"\n00530|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_hi\n00531|     intent write_program_request_unspecified\n00532|     language hi\n00533|     text \"मैं अनुमान से नहीं लिखूँगा. यह program request जैसा लगता है, पर इसमें न यह बताया गया है कि program को करना क्या है, न यह कि उसे किस programming language में लिखना है.\\n\\nबताइए कि program को क्या करना चाहिए और किस भाषा में लिखा जाए, फिर मैं उसे derive कर दूँगा.\"\n00534|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_zh\n00535|     intent write_program_request_unspecified\n00536|     language zh\n00537|     text \"我不会猜测要写什么。这看起来是一个程序请求，但它既没有说明程序要做什么，也没有说明用哪种编程语言来写。\\n\\n请说明程序应当做什么、用哪种语言编写，我就会把它推导出来。\"\n00538|   response response_write_program_request_unspecified_es\n00539|     intent write_program_request_unspecified\n00540|     language es\n00541|     text \"No voy a adivinar qué escribir. Esto se lee como una solicitud de programa, pero no nombra ni lo que el programa debe hacer ni en qué lenguaje de programación escribirlo.\\n\\nDi qué debe hacer el programa y en qué lenguaje debe escribirse, y lo derivaré.\"\n00542|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_heading_en\n00543|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_heading\n00544|     language en\n00545|     text \"Meta algorithm for constructing conversion algorithms:\"\n00546|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_heading_ru\n00547|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_heading\n00548|     language ru\n00549|     text \"Метаалгоритм построения алгоритмов преобразования:\"\n00550|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_heading_hi\n00551|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_heading\n00552|     language hi\n00553|     text \"रूपांतरण एल्गोरिदम बनाने के लिए मेटा एल्गोरिदम:\"\n00554|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_heading_zh\n00555|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_heading\n00556|     language zh\n00557|     text \"用于构建转换算法的元算法：\"\n00558|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_heading_es\n00559|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_heading\n00560|     language es\n00561|     text \"Metaalgoritmo para construir algoritmos de conversión:\"\n00562|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_stage_en\n00563|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_stage\n00564|     language en\n00565|     text \"{index}. {stage} -> {output}; verification fixture: {verifier}.\"\n00566|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_stage_ru\n00567|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_stage\n00568|     language ru\n00569|     text \"{index}. {stage} -> {output}; проверочный пример: {verifier}.\"\n00570|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_stage_hi\n00571|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_stage\n00572|     language hi\n00573|     text \"{index}. {stage} -> {output}; सत्यापन उदाहरण: {verifier}।\"\n00574|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_stage_zh\n00575|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_stage\n00576|     language zh\n00577|     text \"{index}. {stage} -> {output}；验证样例：{verifier}。\"\n00578|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_stage_es\n00579|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_stage\n00580|     language es\n00581|     text \"{index}. {stage} -> {output}; caso de verificación: {verifier}.\"\n00582|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_surface_en\n00583|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_surface\n00584|     language en\n00585|     text \"- {surface}{active}: {projection}.\"\n00586|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_surface_ru\n00587|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_surface\n00588|     language ru\n00589|     text \"- {surface}{active}: {projection}.\"\n00590|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_surface_hi\n00591|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_surface\n00592|     language hi\n00593|     text \"- {surface}{active}: {projection}।\"\n00594|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_surface_zh\n00595|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_surface\n00596|     language zh\n00597|     text \"- {surface}{active}：{projection}。\"\n00598|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_surface_es\n00599|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_surface\n00600|     language es\n00601|     text \"- {surface}{active}: {projection}.\"\n00602|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading_en\n00603|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading\n00604|     language en\n00605|     text \"Coding solutions using the same meta algorithm:\"\n00606|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading_ru\n00607|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading\n00608|     language ru\n00609|     text \"Решения для программирования, использующие тот же метаалгоритм:\"\n00610|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading_hi\n00611|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading\n00612|     language hi\n00613|     text \"उसी मेटा एल्गोरिदम का उपयोग करने वाले कोडिंग समाधान:\"\n00614|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading_zh\n00615|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading\n00616|     language zh\n00617|     text \"使用同一元算法的编程解决方案：\"\n00618|   response response_coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading_es\n00619|     intent coding_meta_algorithm_solutions_heading\n00620|     language es\n00621|     text \"Soluciones de programación que usan el mismo metaalgoritmo:\"\n00622|   response response_coding_synthesis_verified_answer_en\n00623|     intent coding_synthesis_verified_answer\n00624|     language en\n00625|     text \"Here is a derived Python artifact reconstructed from discovered parts and verified in an isolated workspace:\\n\\n```python\\n{source}\\n```\\n\\nExecution status: tests passed in isolated bounded agent workspace.\\nCheck command: `python3 solution.py`\\nTest outcome: {count}/{count} executable checks passed.\\nWorkspace isolation: temporary agent workspace with no inherited environment beyond a constructed temporary directory, and a bounded command budget.\"\n00626|   response response_coding_synthesis_verified_answer_ru\n00627|     intent coding_synthesis_verified_answer\n00628|     language ru\n00629|     text \"Ниже приведён выведенный артефакт Python, собранный из найденных частей и проверенный в изолированной рабочей среде:\\n\\n```python\\n{source}\\n```\\n\\nСтатус выполнения: тесты пройдены в изолированной ограниченной рабочей среде агента.\\nКоманда проверки: `python3 solution.py`\\nРезультат тестов: пройдено {count}/{count} исполняемых проверок.\\nИзоляция: временная рабочая среда агента без унаследованного окружения и с ограниченным бюджетом команд.\"\n00630|   response response_coding_synthesis_verified_answer_hi\n00631|     intent coding_synthesis_verified_answer\n00632|     language hi\n00633|     text \"यह खोजे गए भागों से पुनर्निर्मित और पृथक workspace में सत्यापित Python artifact है:\\n\\n```python\\n{source}\\n```\\n\\nExecution status: सीमित पृथक agent workspace में tests pass हुए।\\nजाँच command: `python3 solution.py`\\nTest outcome: {count}/{count} executable checks pass हुए।\\nWorkspace isolation: inherited environment के बिना अस्थायी agent workspace और सीमित command budget।\"\n00634|   response response_coding_synthesis_verified_answer_zh\n00635|     intent coding_synthesis_verified_answer\n00636|     language zh\n00637|     text \"这是由发现的部件重建并在隔离工作区中验证的 Python 构件：\\n\\n```python\\n{source}\\n```\\n\\n执行状态：测试已在受限的隔离代理工作区中通过。\\n检查命令：`python3 solution.py`\\n测试结果：{count}/{count} 个可执行检查通过。\\n工作区隔离：临时代理工作区不继承环境，并受命令预算限制。\"\n00638|   response response_coding_synthesis_verified_answer_es\n00639|     intent coding_synthesis_verified_answer\n00640|     language es\n00641|     text \"Este es un artefacto de Python derivado, reconstruido a partir de partes descubiertas y verificado en un espacio aislado:\\n\\n```python\\n{source}\\n```\\n\\nEstado de ejecución: las pruebas pasaron en el espacio aislado y limitado del agente.\\nComando de comprobación: `python3 solution.py`\\nResultado: {count}/{count} comprobaciones ejecutables pasaron.\\nAislamiento: espacio temporal sin entorno heredado y con un presupuesto de comandos limitado.\"\n00642|   response response_coding_rosetta_answer_en\n00643|     intent coding_rosetta_answer\n00644|     language en\n00645|     text \"This {language} example for {task} was retrieved from Rosetta Code; it was not generated:\\n\\n```{language}\\n{code}\\n```\\n\\nSource: {source}\\nLicense: {license}\\n{execution}\\n{capture}\"\n00646|   response response_coding_rosetta_answer_ru\n00647|     intent coding_rosetta_answer\n00648|     language ru\n00649|     text \"Этот пример на {language} для задачи {task} получен с Rosetta Code, а не сгенерирован:\\n\\n```{language}\\n{code}\\n```\\n\\nИсточник: {source}\\nЛицензия: {license}\\n{execution}\\n{capture}\"\n00650|   response response_coding_rosetta_answer_hi\n00651|     intent coding_rosetta_answer\n00652|     language hi\n00653|     text \"{task} के लिए यह {language} उदाहरण Rosetta Code से लिया गया है; इसे generate नहीं किया गया:\\n\\n```{language}\\n{code}\\n```\\n\\nस्रोत: {source}\\nलाइसेंस: {license}\\n{execution}\\n{capture}\"\n00654|   response response_coding_rosetta_answer_zh\n00655|     intent coding_rosetta_answer\n00656|     language zh\n00657|     text \"这个用于 {task} 的 {language} 示例来自 Rosetta Code，并非生成：\\n\\n```{language}\\n{code}\\n```\\n\\n来源：{source}\\n许可证：{license}\\n{execution}\\n{capture}\"\n00658|   response response_coding_rosetta_answer_es\n00659|     intent coding_rosetta_answer\n00660|     language es\n00661|     text \"Este ejemplo de {language} para {task} se obtuvo de Rosetta Code; no fue generado:\\n\\n```{language}\\n{code}\\n```\\n\\nFuente: {source}\\nLicencia: {license}\\n{execution}\\n{capture}\"\n00662|   response response_coding_rosetta_not_requested_en\n00663|     intent coding_rosetta_not_requested\n00664|     language en\n00665|     text \"Execution status: not requested.\"\n00666|   response response_coding_rosetta_not_requested_ru\n00667|     intent coding_rosetta_not_requested\n00668|     language ru\n00669|     text \"Статус выполнения: запуск не запрашивался.\"\n00670|   response response_coding_rosetta_not_requested_hi\n00671|     intent coding_rosetta_not_requested\n00672|     language hi\n00673|     text \"Execution status: चलाने का अनुरोध नहीं किया गया।\"\n00674|   response response_coding_rosetta_not_requested_zh\n00675|     intent coding_rosetta_not_requested\n00676|     language zh\n00677|     text \"执行状态：未请求运行。\"\n00678|   response response_coding_rosetta_not_requested_es\n00679|     intent coding_rosetta_not_requested\n00680|     language es\n00681|     text \"Estado de ejecución: no solicitado.\"\n00682|   response response_coding_rosetta_rust_only_en\n00683|     intent coding_rosetta_rust_only\n00684|     language en\n00685|     text \"Execution status: not run; bounded execution is currently available only for Rust examples, not {language}.\"\n00686|   response response_coding_rosetta_rust_only_ru\n00687|     intent coding_rosetta_rust_only\n00688|     language ru\n00689|     text \"Статус выполнения: не запущено; ограниченное выполнение пока доступно только для примеров Rust, но не {language}.\"\n00690|   response response_coding_rosetta_rust_only_hi\n00691|     intent coding_rosetta_rust_only\n00692|     language hi\n00693|     text \"Execution status: नहीं चलाया गया; सीमित execution अभी केवल Rust उदाहरणों के लिए उपलब्ध है, {language} के लिए नहीं।\"\n00694|   response response_coding_rosetta_rust_only_zh\n00695|     intent coding_rosetta_rust_only\n00696|     language zh\n00697|     text \"执行状态：未运行；受限执行目前仅适用于 Rust 示例，不适用于 {language}。\"\n00698|   response response_coding_rosetta_rust_only_es\n00699|     intent coding_rosetta_rust_only\n00700|     language es\n00701|     text \"Estado de ejecución: no ejecutado; la ejecución limitada solo está disponible para ejemplos de Rust, no de {language}.\"\n00702|   response