ide Python 运行时已加载；现在可在浏览器 worker 中观察明确的运行请求。\\\"\\n00218|   response response_browser_runtime_ready_es\\n00219|     intent browser_runtime_ready\\n00220|     language es\\n00221|     text \\\"El entorno Python Pyodide está cargado; ahora se puede observar una solicitud explícita de ejecución en el worker del navegador.\\\"\\n00222|   response response_verifiable_task_verified_en\\n00223|     intent verifiable_task_verified\\n00224|     language en\\n00225|     text \\\"Computed and corroborated by an independent check.\\\"\\n00226|   response response_verifiable_task_verified_ru\\n00227|     intent verifiable_task_verified\\n00228|     language ru\\n00229|     text \\\"Вычислено и подтверждено независимой проверкой.\\\"\\n00230|   response response_verifiable_task_verified_hi\\n00231|     intent verifiable_task_verified\\n00232|     language hi\\n00233|     text \\\"गणना की गई और स्वतंत्र जाँच से पुष्ट किया गया।\\\"\\n00234|   response response_verifiable_task_verified_zh\\n00235|     intent verifiable_task_verified\\n00236|     language zh\\n00237|     text \\\"已计算并由独立检查相互印证。\\\"\\n00238|   response response_verifiable_task_verified_es\\n00239|     intent verifiable_task_verified\\n00240|     language es\\n00241|     text \\\"Calculado y corroborado mediante una comprobación independiente.\\\"\\n00242|   response response_verifiable_task_uncorroborated_en\\n00243|     intent verifiable_task_uncorroborated\\n00244|     language en\\n00245|     text \\\"Computed, but not independently corroborated.\\\"\\n00246|   response response_verifiable_task_uncorroborated_ru\\n00247|     intent verifiable_task_uncorroborated\\n00248|     language ru\\n00249|     text \\\"Вычислено, но не подтверждено независимой проверкой.\\\"\\n00250|   response response_verifiable_task_uncorroborated_hi\\n00251|     intent verifiable_task_uncorroborated\\n00252|     language hi\\n00253|     text \\\"गणना की गई, पर स्वतंत्र रूप से पुष्ट नहीं हुई।\\\"\\n00254|   response response_verifiable_task_uncorroborated_zh\\n00255|     intent verifiable_task_uncorroborated\\n00256|     language zh\\n00257|     text \\\"已计算，但尚未得到独立印证。\\\"\\n00258|   response response_verifiable_task_uncorroborated_es\\n00259|     intent verifiable_task_uncorroborated\\n00260|     language es\\n00261|     text \\\"Calculado, pero sin corroboración independiente.\\\"\\n00262|   response response_verifiable_task_gap_en\\n00263|     intent verifiable_task_gap\\n00264|     language en\\n00265|     text \\\"I could not derive a checked answer from the available evidence. The research trail is recorded; no value was guessed.\\\"\\n00266|   response response_verifiable_task_gap_ru\\n00267|     intent verifiable_task_gap\\n00268|     language ru\\n00269|     text \\\"Мне не удалось вывести проверяемый ответ из доступных свидетельств. Ход исследования записан; значение не угадывалось.\\\"\\n00270|   response response_verifiable_task_gap_hi\\n00271|     intent verifiable_task_gap\\n00272|     language hi\\n00273|     text \\\"उपलब्ध साक्ष्य से जाँचा हुआ उत्तर नहीं निकला। शोध क्रम दर्ज है; कोई मान अनुमान से नहीं दिया गया।\\\"\\n00274|   response response_verifiable_task_gap_zh\\n00275|     intent verifiable_task_gap\\n00276|     language zh\\n00277|     text \\\"无法从现有证据推导出经检查的答案。研究轨迹已记录；没有猜测任何值。\\\"\\n00278|   response response_verifiable_task_gap_es\\n00279|     intent verifiable_task_gap\\n00280|     language es\\n00281|     text \\\"No pude derivar una respuesta comprobada de la evidencia disponible. El recorrido de investigación queda registrado; no se adivinó ningún valor.\\\"\\n00282|   response response_verifiable_task_browser_unverified_en\\n00283|     intent verifiable_task_browser_unverified\\n00284|     language en\\n00285|     text \\\"I recognized a `{expectation}` verifiable task and formalized its requirements. This browser has no executor for the derived program, so the result remains unverified and no value is presented as an answer.\\\"\\n00286|   response response_verifiable_